{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrestledunk your friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/extras/bba3ca566a3feeb079b2273f3d7c2617.poster.avif?t=1761727356\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/extras/bba3ca566a3feeb079b2273f3d7c2617.webm?t=1761727356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/extras/bba3ca566a3feeb079b2273f3d7c2617.mp4?t=1761727356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spike, squish, stab, wrestle and dunk your way to victory in a pack of multiplayer sports games! Get into the super competitive local and online multiplayer action for up to 8 players. <strong>Try out the free demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out all the sports, like Fencing, Wrestling and Smashball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local multiplayer for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm up or round out the teams with AIs for every sport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of arenas and modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up controls, hard to master moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer mode for online play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easy to get a match going with Wrestledunk's custom cross-platform rollback netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you have 4 local players and face off against 4 others online? Of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone destroying you at Smashball? Switch up the sports and teams seamlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure? Try out Wrestling and Volleyball in the free demo online with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller recommended.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1301520?t=1761727356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761727356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761727356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761727356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1323170,"description":"Wrestledunk Sports Demo"}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrestledunk your friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/extras/bba3ca566a3feeb079b2273f3d7c2617.poster.avif?t=1761727356\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/extras/bba3ca566a3feeb079b2273f3d7c2617.webm?t=1761727356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301520/extras/bba3ca566a3feeb079b2273f3d7c2617.mp4?t=1761727356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spike, squish, stab, wrestle and dunk your way to victory in a pack of multiplayer sports games! Get into the super competitive local and online multiplayer action for up to 8 players. <strong>Try out the free demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out all the sports, like Fencing, Wrestling and Smashball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local multiplayer for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm up or round out the teams with AIs for every sport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of arenas and modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up controls, hard to master moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer mode for online play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easy to get a match going with Wrestledunk's custom cross-platform rollback netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you have 4 local players and face off against 4 others online? Of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone destroying you at Smashball? Switch up the sports and teams seamlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure? Try out Wrestling and Volleyball in the free demo online with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller recommended.</p>","developers":["Team Fractal Alligator"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akama